  "description": "<p>Currently if you POST to the fcr:versions endpoint of a non-versioned resource, it will automatically make it versionable, generate the Timemap container and continue to generate the Memento.</p>\n\n<p><tt>curl -i -X PUT --user fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/versioning/v3\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/versioning/v3</a></tt><br/>\n<tt>curl -i --user fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/versioning/v3\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/versioning/v3</a></tt><br/>\n<tt>curl -i -X POST --user fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin \"http://localhost:8080/rest/versioning/v3/fcr:versions\"</tt><br/>\n<tt>curl -i --user fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/versioning/v3\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/versioning/v3</a></tt></p>",
